{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08969","headline":"扬州偶会前洛阳卢耿主簿 · 韦应物","name":"扬州偶会前洛阳卢耿主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚塞故人稀，相逢本不期。\n犹存袖里字，忽怪鬓中丝。\n客舍盈樽酒，江行满箧诗。\n更能连骑出，还似洛桥时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}